<title>UK: Woolwich third auction gets 285.8p/shr.</title>
<headline>Woolwich third auction gets 285.8p/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly-floated Woolwich Plc said on Thursday that the average price of bids in its third auction was 285.7967p per share.  </p>
<p>The former building society said a further 92.553 million shares were offered for sale on Wednesday. The range of the bids was from 285p to 297p per share.</p>
<p>Woolwich is holding its final auction after the close of trading today at which it is offering 92.553 million shares, or 5.8 percent of its share capital, for sale.</p>
<p>Woolwich made its debut on the London Stock Exchange on Monday at 368p before closing at 334p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
